    <Replace Tag="TXT_KEY_ARC_ENGLAND_DAWN" Text="Tarant, the smoke of ten thousand chimneys hangs over the greatest city the world has ever seen. The Industrial Council rules by patent and by purse, the steam engine has changed everything in a single lifetime, and the old powers of the continent look on with envy and fear.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Build the factories, lay the rails, fill the sky with airships and make Arcanum a market for Tarantian goods. The age of magick is ending; make sure the age that replaces it bears your name." />
