    <Replace Tag="TXT_KEY_ARC_FRANCE_DAWN" Text="Caladon, oldest of the human kingdoms, the city of white towers at the edge of the southern sea. Your nobles still remember when every court in Arcanum bowed to Caladon, and they intend to see those days return, by steam or by sorcery.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Arland is yours to settle, the sea lanes are yours to command, and the upstart merchants of Tarant have yet to learn that gold cannot buy a thousand years of history." />
