    <Replace Tag="TXT_KEY_ARC_RUSSIA_DAWN" Text="Cumbria, land of knights and old oaths, where King Praetor still holds court in the grey halls of Dernholm and the sword is worth more than the ledger. The engines of Tarant are an insult to everything your fathers stood for, and yet the smoke keeps creeping north.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Hold the passes of the Stonewall, keep the barons loyal and the orcs in their hills, and decide whether Cumbria will meet the new age with a lance or with a locomotive." />
