    <Replace Tag="TXT_KEY_ARC_GERMANY_DAWN" Text="Loghaire Thunder Stone, king of the Wheel Clan, your people carved the first engines while humans were still counting on their fingers, and your mountain holds the deepest mines on the continent. Now the humans have learned your secrets and are selling them back to you.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Bring the clans together, dig deeper than anyone has dared, and show the surface world what dwarven engineering can do when it is finally allowed to leave the mountain." />
