    <Replace Tag="TXT_KEY_ARC_SWEDEN_DAWN" Text="Vendigroth, the city that was supposed to have died two thousand years ago. In this history the devices still hum beneath the wastes, the Technocrat Council still convenes, and the rest of Arcanum is only now inventing what your ancestors threw away.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Your province is a desert and your people are few, but your knowledge is centuries ahead. Trade it, guard it, or use it, and remember what happened the last time Vendigroth frightened the world." />
